<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z MAY NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z MAY NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.06 vs   0.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.65 vs   1.15</p>
